  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Jeffrey (or Jeffery) Hawkins, photographer, is listed in <ref target="civic?id=Queensberry%20Street">Queensberry Street</ref> in the Sands &amp; McDougall directories from 1858 to 1875. He is at No. 12 in 1859 and 1860, and No. 20 from 1861. From 1864 to 1868 the listing takes in Nos 20 and 22, then Nos 20, 22 and 24.</p>
    </body>
